OL,3,GNEWSACrews still battling industrial
OL,4,Afire after blasts heard
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are continuing to tackle a
OL,7,Flarge fire that broke out following
OL,8,Fexplosions at an industrial unit.
OL,10,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,11,Fto Emery Road in the Brislington area
OL,12,Fof Bristol at about 14:30 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday. Firefighters from nine
OL,14,Fstations across Bristol, North Somerset
OL,15,Fand South Gloucestershire were at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
