OL,3,GNEWSACrews still battling industrial
OL,4,Afire after blasts heard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the roof of the
OL,7,Fbuilding on fire has collapsed,
OL,8,Falthough the blaze is now under
OL,9,Fcontrol. Emery Road remains closed,
OL,10,Fcausing extra traffic on surrounding
OL,11,Froads.
OL,13,FA fire service spokesperson said: "Our
OL,14,Fattendance has now been scaled down to
OL,15,Ffive fire engines, but crews remain at
OL,16,Fthe scene and are still working to
OL,17,Ffully extinguish the fire."
